{"sentences":[{"id":"s_work_clt_80_1","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_80","textTraditional":"一、十有七年，春，齊人、徐人伐英氏。","sentenceOrder":1},{"id":"s_work_clt_80_2","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_80","textTraditional":"二、夏，滅項。","sentenceOrder":2},{"id":"s_work_clt_80_3","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_80","textTraditional":"孰滅之？桓公也。何以不言桓公也？為賢者諱也。項，國也。不可滅而滅之乎？桓公知項之可滅也，而不知己之不可以滅也。既滅人之國矣，何賢乎？君子惡惡疾其始，善善樂其終，桓公嘗有存亡繼絕之功，故君子為之諱也。","sentenceOrder":3},{"id":"s_work_clt_80_4","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_80","textTraditional":"三、秋，夫人姜氏會齊侯於卞。","sentenceOrder":4},{"id":"s_work_clt_80_5","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_80","textTraditional":"四、九月，公至自會。","sentenceOrder":5},{"id":"s_work_clt_80_6","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_80","textTraditional":"五、冬，十有二月，乙亥，齊侯小白卒。","sentenceOrder":6},{"id":"s_work_clt_80_7","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_80","textTraditional":"此不正，其日之何也？其不正前見矣。其不正之前見何也？以不正入虛國，故稱嫌焉爾。","sentenceOrder":7}],"overrides":{}}